The supplied now and then values are uint32 millisecond counters. Actual elapsed time is known to be below one full wrap. Find elapsed milliseconds across possible rollover. Supplied values: {"now":20,"then":4294967280}

Result: 36 ms. Unsigned subtraction modulo 2^32 yields elapsed milliseconds when the interval is shorter than one wrap. It cannot recover multiple wraps.

